    <p>The show Catch! Teenieping is one of my <favorite> shows to watch when I’m not busy. The show revolves around the main character Romi, who goes down to earth to <catch> little fairies called Teeniepings that go missing on earth. Each season has a new set of Teeniepings to catch like dessert, jewel, key, emotion, princess/prince, and star. Within every set of Teeniepings are royal Teeniepings that help Romi <transform> into a princess to catch the regular Teeniepings. Once they are all caught, they go back to their home. This show has been one I’ve watched for a long time and recommend it to anyone who likes a cute magical girl show or for anyone who likes <cartoons> in general. This is the perfect show to watch when you’re bored! Some of the Teeniepings are Heartsping, Joahping, Trueping, Shashaping, Sparkleping and Bonnyping. Those are among the many royal Teeniepings included in the series. In the series, there’s ups and downs, <plot twists> and fun episodes to see. </p>
